{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-05-03 14:13:00', 'title': 'A SUBSTANTIAL TRANSACTION IN THE RENEWABLE ENERGY MARKET: MIGDAL, A PROMINENT ISRAELI INSURANCE COMPANY, WILL INVEST APPROXIMATELY $355 MILLION IN GLOBAL ENERGY GENERATION LLC (DORAL LLC)', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MIGDAL, A PROMINENT ISRAELI INSURANCE COMPANY, WILL INVEST APPROXIMATELY $355 MILLION IN GLOBAL ENERGY GENERATION LLC (DORAL LLC). RENEWABLES.'}{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-05-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'AEP ENERGY AND GLOBAL ENERGY GENERATION EXECUTE SOLAR POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT IN PJM', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AEP ENERGY, A SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) AND ONE OF THE LARGEST ELECTRIC ENERGY WHOLESALE AND RETAIL SUPPLIERS IN THE U.S., AND GLOBAL ENERGY GENERATION LLC (DORAL LLC), A LEADING DEVELOPER OF RENEWABLE ENERGY PROJECTS, PRIMARILY IN THE MIDWEST AND MID-ATLANTIC REGIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY HAVE SIGNED A LONG-TERM RENEWABLE ENERGY PURCHASE AGREEMENT FOR THE MAMMOTH SOLAR PROJECT IN INDIANA. MAMMOTH SOLAR 1, A 480 MEGAWATT DIRECT CURRENT (MWDC) SOLAR ENERGY PROJECT, IS THE FIRST PHASE OF THE 1.65 GIGAWATT DIRECT CURRENT (GWDC) MAMMOTH PROJECT BEING DEVELOPED BY DORAL LLC.'}